to solve all the major

00:00:09.874 --> 00:00:11.006
problems of the world.

00:00:11.006 --> 00:00:12.744
So to help you on your journey today

00:00:12.744 --> 00:00:15.769
we're going to learn seven
ways to crush it in your niche

00:00:15.769 --> 00:00:17.475
on social media.

00:00:17.475 --> 00:00:19.256
And always, guys, as you're listening,

00:00:19.256 --> 00:00:21.051
