really resonates with you,

00:00:21.051 --> 00:00:22.601
please leave it down
in the comments below,

00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:24.088
put quotes around it so other people

00:00:24.088 --> 00:00:25.516
can be inspired as well.

00:00:25.516 --> 00:00:27.679
And when you write it down,
it's much more likely to stick

00:00:27.679 --> 00:00:29.322
with yourself too.

00:00:29.322 --> 00:00:30.155
Enjoy.

